 "official_summary": " <p><b>7(a) Real Estate Appraisal Harmonization Act </b></p> <p>(Sec. 2) This bill amends the Small Business Act to revise the loan amount above which a real estate appraisal is required for a commercial real property securing a small business loan. Specifically, the bill ties the amount to the federal banking regulator appraisal threshold. (Currently, an appraisal is required for a loan of more than $250,000.)</p>",
